## 9. WebSocket接口

### 9.1 连接建立

**连接地址**：wss://api.pindou.com/ws?token={access_token}&device_id={device_id}

**功能说明**：建立WebSocket长连接，用于接收实时消息推送，如生成进度、互动通知等。

### 9.2 消息类型

**生成进度消息：**
```json
{
  "type": "diagram_progress",
  "data": {
    "task_id": "task_abc",
    "progress": 65,
    "current_stage": "正在映射色号"
  }
}
```

**生成完成消息：**
```json
{
  "type": "diagram_complete",
  "data": {
    "task_id": "task_abc",
    "diagram_id": "dia_abc",
    "preview_url": "https://..."
  }
}
```

**生成失败消息：**
```json
{
  "type": "diagram_error",
  "data": {
    "task_id": "task_abc",
    "error_message": "图片无法识别"
  }
}
```

**新消息通知：**
```json
{
  "type": "new_message",
  "data": {
    "message_type": "comment",
    "message_id": "msg_abc"
  }
}
```

